flowchart TD
    P[Profile plus validated catalog] --> R[Compute all deterministic eligibility outcomes and scores]
    R --> I[Exclude known failures and closed cycles from agent input; take top 12]
    I --> START([LangGraph START])
    START --> D[Discovery node: select or reorder supplied catalog IDs]
    KS[Optional Keenable search: separate unverified leads] -.-> D
    D --> RT[Bounded research: choose fetch, search, clarify or finish]
    RT --> E[Evidence node: assess claims against exact source passages]
    E --> Q{Missing decisive evidence and one approved follow-up available?}
    Q -->|Yes, once| RF[Discovery chooses fetch or finish; controller validates]
    RF -->|New receipt| E
    RF -->|Finish or unavailable| F
    Q -->|No| F
    F[Fit node: reorder selected IDs using constraints and evidence uncertainty]
    F --> END([LangGraph END])
    END --> OUT[Prioritize selected IDs; retain all baseline catalog outcomes for filtering]
    OUT --> UI[Explore and details]
    UI --> SELECT[Student selects an opportunity]
    SELECT --> PLAN[Planning specialist: separate on-demand function]
    CONTRACT[Shared schemas and exact ID checks] -.-> D
    CONTRACT -.-> E
    CONTRACT -.-> F
    CONTRACT -.-> PLAN
    FB[Stage exception: retain local result and record visible Fallback event] -.-> D
    FB -.-> E
    FB -.-> F
